      "For aging-in-place buyers and snowbirds, DC Ranch single-story product is among the most architecturally refined in North Scottsdale at this footprint. The trade-off is price band: single-story trophy estates on the upper canyon parcels run well into the eight figures. Mid-range single-story product in the older villages typically clears in the multi-million-dollar segment depending on lot, view orientation, and finish level.",
      "Architectural Control Committee strictness inside DC Ranch is meaningful and applies particularly to exterior remodels and additions. Buyers planning to convert a two-story home to single-story (sometimes considered for legacy aging-in-place) should verify ACC posture before any contract; vertical-footprint changes are not always approved. Verify current inventory and pricing against ARMLS."
