      "The DC Ranch and Silverleaf ACCs are unusually strict on contemporary architecture. Buyers planning a more architecturally adventurous custom build should validate the ACC posture before committing to a lot: contemporary-desert vocabulary is increasingly accepted but is not universally approved across every sub-village. Verify current lot inventory through the master developer and ACC posture during diligence."
