      "The trade-off is geography. The Boulders sits further from Sky Harbor (roughly 40 minutes) and the central-Scottsdale retail belt than 85255 alternatives. For the right snowbird buyer the trade is worth it; for buyers prioritizing airport proximity, alternatives further south fit better. Verify current inventory and pricing against ARMLS."
