      "Terravita is one of the largest Del Webb-built golf communities in North Scottsdale, sitting in 85266 immediately northwest of Pinnacle Peak: popular with, though not restricted to, the 55+ buyer. Single-story inventory is the dominant product type by design: the community master-planned around aging-in-place and snowbird use cases from the start. Architecture leans Santa Barbara and Spanish Colonial Revival, with mature landscape and a unified streetscape that has held up gracefully.",
